<div class="py-8"><h1 class="font-display text-2xl mb-2">Review queue</h1><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Oldest first. Every RDU member sees every pending submission and every draft — access here is role-based, not per project.</p><div class="data-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Pending submissions" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Pending submissions</caption><thead><tr><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Shortcode</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Project</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Last editor</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Submitted</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Status</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Actions</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0801d</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell">A Depositor</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-03 08:15 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="badge badge-warning badge-md">Waiting</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><form method="post" action="/review/0801d"><input type="hidden" name="intent" value="claim"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" aria-label="Start review 0801d">Start review</button></form></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 class="font-display text-xl mt-10 mb-2">Drafts in progress</h2><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Work a depositor has saved but not submitted. Nothing here is waiting on you; open one to help somebody who is stuck.</p><div class="data-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Drafts in progress" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Drafts in progress</caption><thead><tr><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Shortcode</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Project</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Last editor</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Last saved</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">080C</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/projects/080C" class="link ">Anton Webern</a></td><td class="data-table-cell">A Depositor</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 11:00 UTC</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
